{81 = 81-94}
332=81.	I am @wRN{Šulgi}, god of manliness, the foremost of the troops. 
336=82.	When I stretch the bowstring on the bow, when I fit a perfect arrow to it, 
340=83.	I shoot the bow's arrow with the full strength of my arms. 
344=84.	The great wild bull, the bull of heaven, the wild cow and the bison bellow. 
348=85.	As they pass across the foothills of the mountains, 
352=86.	I shoot barbed arrows at them with my powerful strength. 
