424=105.	I can throw a ball (?) as high in the air as if it were a rag. 
428=106.	I can bring down quadrupeds lightning-quick with the sling. 
432=107.	I, @wRN{Šulgi}, can catch a goat with a quick pace; 
436=108.	nothing checks my power. …… has been given to me. 
440=109.	Wherever I direct my steps, I always achieve something; 
