{118 = 118-130}
480=118.	I, the king, am the Land's most excellent fighter against the enemy. 
484=119.	I, @wRN{Šulgi}, am respected for my immense bodily strength. I am mighty; 
488=120.	nothing resists me; I know no setbacks. 
492=121.	My barges on the river do not sink (?) under me @noteref{alludes to a proverb (?)}; my teams of asses do not collapse under me. 
496=122.	Striding forward like my brother and friend, the youth @wDN{Utu}, 
500=123.	as if with the legs of a lion, 
504=124.	I am the good groom of my dust-making asses that bray like lions roaring. 
508=125.	Like that of a stallion, my strength is unwavering during the running-race; 
512=126.	I come first in the race, 
516=127.	and my knees do not get tired. 
520=128.	I am fearless; I dance with joy. 
524=129.	My words shall never be forgotten. 
528=130.	Praise for me because of my reliable judgments is on everyone's lips. 

{131 = 131-149}
