536=132.	I am the very @wDN{Nintur} @noteref{creator deity} of the collections of omens. 
540=133.	These words of the gods are of pre-eminent value for the exact performance of hand-washing and purification rites, 
544=134.	for eulogy of the @fsux{en} priestess or for her enthronement in the @fsux{ŋipar}, 
