{154 = 154-174}
624=154.	I, @wRN{Šulgi}, king of @wSN{Urim}, have also devoted myself to the art of music. 
628=155.	Nothing is too complicated for me; 
632=156.	I know the full extent of the @fsux{tigi} and the @fsux{adab}, 
636=157.	the perfection of the art of music. When I fix the frets on the lute, 
640=158.	which enraptures my heart, I never damage its neck; 
644=159.	I have devised rules for raising and lowering its intervals. 
648=160.	On the @fsux{gu-uš} lyre I know the melodious tuning. 
652=161.	I am familiar with the @fsux{sa-eš} and with drumming on its musical soundbox. 
