672=166.	as one might to a skilled musician, 
676=167.	a musical instrument that I have not heard before, 
680=168.	when I strike it up I make its true sound known; 
684=169.	I am able to handle it just like something that has been in my hands before. 
688=170.	Tuning, 
692=171.	stringing, 
696=172.	unstringing and fastening are not beyond my skills. 
