836=207.	in the capture of a citadel in @wGN{Elam} ……, 
840=208.	I can understand what their spokesman answers. By origin I am a son of @wGN{Sumer}; 
844=209.	I am a warrior, a warrior of @wGN{Sumer}. Thirdly, 
848=210.	I can conduct a conversation with a man from the black mountains. 
852=211.	Fourthly, 
856=212.	I can do service as a translator with a man of @wEN{Martu}, 
