{221 = 221-243}
892=221.	When I pronounce a completed verdict, it is heartily welcomed, 
896=222.	since I am wise and exalted in kingship. So that my consultative assemblies, 
900=223.	sitting together to care for the people, 
904=224.	inspire respect in their hearts when the chief herald sounds the horn, 
908=225.	they should deliberate and debate; 
912=226.	and so that the council should decide policy properly, 
916=227.	I have taught my governors to deliberate and to debate. 
920=228.	While the words at their dining tables flow like a river, 
924=229.	I tackle crime, 
928=230.	so that the foundations are securely established for my wide dominions. 
932=231.	I vanquish a city with words as weapons, 
936=232.	and my wisdom keeps it subjected just as violence with burning torches would. 
940=233.	I have taught them the meaning of the words @q{“I have no mother”}. 
944=234.	My words can be words smooth as the finest quality oil; 
948=235.	I know how to cool hearts which are hot as fire, 
952=236.	and I know how to extinguish a mouth set on fire like a reedbed. 
956=237.	I weigh my words against those of the braggart. 
960=238.	I am a man of the very highest standards of value. 
964=239.	The importance of the humble is of particular value to me, 
968=240.	and they cannot be counter-productive to any of my activities. 
972=241.	By command of @wDN{An} and by command of @wDN{Enlil}, 
976=242.	prayers are said for the life of the Land and for the life of the foreign lands, 
980=243.	and I neither neglect them nor allow them to be interrupted. 

