{259 = 259-269}
1044=259.	I have no equal among even the most distant rulers, 
1048=260.	and I can also state that my deeds are great deeds. 
1052=261.	Everything is achievable by me, the king. 
1056=262.	Since the time when @wDN{Enlil} gave me the direction of his numerous people in view of my wisdom, 
1060=263.	my extraordinary power and my justice, in view of my resolute and unforgettable words, 
1064=264.	and in view of my expertise, 
1068=265.	comparable to that of @wDN{Ištaran}, 
