{270 = 270-280}
1088=270.	I am no fool as regards the knowledge acquired since the time that mankind was, 
1092=271.	from heaven above, set on its path: 
1096=272.	when I have discovered @fsux{tigi} and @fsux{zamzam} hymns from past days, 
