1216=302.	Through becoming familiar thereby with me, 
1220=303.	the king, 
1224=304.	he will speak of me in awed amazement. 
1228=305.	Because of my extraordinary wisdom and my ancient fame as a master, 
1232=306.	he should choose my hymns as examples, 
1236=307.	and himself beget heavenly writings. 

{308 = 308-319}
